    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <section class="col-12 content">
                <div id="ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_EditModePanel1">
	
                 <h1>Accident Data</h1>
                
</div>
                
            </section>
        </div>

        <div class="row">
            <section class="col-8 content">
                <div id="ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_ctl00_label" style='display:none'>Page Content</div><div id="ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_ctl00__ControlWrapper_RichHtmlField" class="ms-rtestate-field" style="display:inline" aria-labelledby="ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_ctl00_label"><h2>​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​Investigation​​​ and Recommendations Database Search<br></h2><p>
   <a href="https&#58;//carol.ntsb.gov/">CAROL</a> (Case Analysis and Reporting Online) allows you to search investigations and recommendations data across all modes.&#160; For more information on CAROL, including details on the data structure, see the 
   <a href="/Pages/CAROL.aspx" style="background-color&#58;#f2f3f4;">CAROL help page</a>​.</p><p>
   <br>
</p><p> 
   <img src="/safety/PublishingImages/stats-banner-OAS.png" alt="" style="margin&#58;5px;" /> 
   <br> 
</p><h2>Census of US Civil Aviation Accidents<br></h2>
<a href="https&#58;//app.ntsb.gov/avdata/Access/">Downloadable data sets</a> of aviation accident data are available for public use. 
<p></p><p>Data sets for 1962 through 1981 (see the 
   <i>PRE1982.zip</i> file) and from 1982 to the present (see the 
   <i>avall.zip</i> file) ​are available for download.​</p><p>Coding manuals, data definitions, and other metadata for different generations of the census are 
   <a href="https&#58;//app.ntsb.gov/avdata/">also available for download​</a>.​</p><p>​A 
   <a href="/Pages/monthly.aspx">monthly list of aviation accidents</a>​ is also available.<br></p><p>A 
   <a href="/safety/data/Pages/daily-publication-dashboard.aspx" target="_blank">daily and pending aviation publication report</a>&#160;is available for viewing.<br></p><h2>​US Civil Aviation Accide​nt Dashboard&#58; 2008-2024​​<br></h2><div>This 
   <a href="https&#58;//app.powerbi.com/view?r=eyJrIjoiNDAzMjQ5NDEtNTU4Mi00M2VjLWI5YTktZTlkYzM5YTVkODljIiwidCI6IjA4YzdlNjU5LTM3NDgtNDQ1YS05ZjVhLWI2ZjYyMzU2ZGViYyIsImMiOjF9">interactive report</a> is a companion to the accident statistics tables. It provides summary statistics for US civil aviation accidents ​occurring from 2008 through 2024​.​​  ​​<br></div><div> 
   <img src="/safety/data/PublishingImages/2c71f38b-357c-456b-adb5-67a765fd9ace.jpg" alt="" style="margin&#58;5px;" />&#160;​​<br></div><div>
   <img src="/safety/PublishingImages/stats-banner-OMS.png" alt="" style="margin&#58;5px;" />&#160;</div><h2>Ma​r​​ine Safety Data Dashboard<br></h2><p>This&#160;<a href="https&#58;//app.powerbi.com/view?r=eyJrIjoiMWFkMWI0ZDQtMzk1YS00N2YxLWFmYWYtNzhiYTY3NDQxYzc5IiwidCI6IjA4YzdlNjU5LTM3NDgtNDQ1YS05ZjVhLWI2ZjYyMzU2ZGViYyIsImMiOjF9">interactive dashboard​</a> summarizes and visualizes NTSB marine investigations occurring from 2012 to the present. ​​ ​​Data for investigations occurring before 2012 will be added in future releases.</p><p>Users can view data using the Investigation Map and Case Summary dashboard pages. Both dashboard pages are filterable by event date, vessel name(s), case status (open or closed), NTSB vessel group, and NTSB casualty category.&#160;</p><p> 
   <img src="/safety/PublishingImages/OMS%20Data%20Dashboard.png" alt="" style="margin&#58;5px;width&#58;680px;height&#58;376px;" />​ 
   <br> </p>​ 
<div style="text-align&#58;right;">
   <em>Updated September 3, 2026</em>&#160;&#160;<em></em>​<br>​<br>​<br></div></div>
            </section>
            <aside class="col-4 sidebar">
                <div id="ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_ctl01_label" style='display:none'>Page Content 2</div><div id="ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_ctl01__ControlWrapper_RichHtmlField" class="ms-rtestate-field" style="display:inline" aria-labelledby="ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_ctl01_label"><h2>Requests and Questions</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto&#58;data@ntsb.gov"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="bfdbdecbdeffd1cbccdd91d8d0c9">[email&#160;protected]</span></a> to make requests and ask data-related questions.</p><ul><li>​​Office of&#160;Aviation Safety <a href="/safety/Pages/research.aspx">Data Dashboard</a></li><li>Office of Marine Safety <a href="/safety/Pages/Marine-Safety-Data-Dashboard.aspx">Data Dashboard</a>​<br>​<br><br></li></ul></div>
            </aside>
        </div>
    </div>
